 SCENARIO: READY/VALID (immediate full indication)
==========================================================================
  Rule : the producer sends only when the FIFO has space THIS cycle.
  Gain : lossless, the simplest form of backpressure.
  Cost : needs a combinational full/ready path from the consumer side to the producer,
         which is not always possible over a long or pipelined link.
  Expect: 0 drops, consumer 100% busy, the producer is stalled most cycles.
