  Rule : a stall flag is raised only when the FIFO is FULL, and it takes 3 cycles to reach
         the producer.
  Risk : during those cycles the producer keeps sending into a FIFO that has no room left.
         Backpressure exists, but it is too late.
  Expect: fewer drops than 'none', but still DATA LOSS.
